  "_comment": "Model names are editable defaults; verify them against your provider accounts. Providers are tried in order; keys come from environment/.env (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY). Without any key the router returns None and callers use rule-based logic.",
  "tiers": {
